  displayName: Thalassa Space Elevator
  kind: 9
  description: 'A space elevator: Thalassa turns once in about six hours, so an orbit 400 km up keeps pace with the ground. A tether runs from a sea platform on the equator up to the Highport there, and on to a counterweight beyond, and climbers ride it up and down.'
